# Where each deferred phrase shape is checked. Their answers are compared
# with a positional index in phrase_deferred_matrix.test, which
# tests/sqllogic/generators/sdb/pg/index/phrase_deferred_matrix.py
# generates from the same rows.

statement ok
CREATE TEXT SEARCH DICTIONARY pdm_words AS split_text(case := 'lower') WITH (frequency)

statement ok
CREATE TEXT SEARCH DICTIONARY pdm_syn AS
    split_text(case := 'lower') | expand_solr_synonyms('car, automobile, auto')
    WITH (frequency)

statement ok
CREATE TABLE pdm (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, body VARCHAR)

statement ok
INSERT INTO pdm SELECT i, (SELECT string_agg(['quick', 'quack', 'quiet', 'brown', 'brawn', 'brow', 'fox', 'box', 'fix', 'the', 'a', 'dog', 'dot', 'red', 'car', 'auto', 'automobile', 'big'][1 + (hash(i, j) % 18)::INTEGER], ' ') FROM range(1 + (hash(i) % 12)::INTEGER) r(j)) FROM range(600) t(i)

statement ok
CREATE INDEX pdm_text ON pdm USING inverted (id, body pdm_words) INCLUDE (body)

statement ok
CREATE INDEX pdm_syn_text ON pdm USING inverted (id, body pdm_syn) INCLUDE (body)

statement ok
VACUUM (REFRESH_TABLE) pdm

statement ok
CREATE TABLE pdm_s (id INTEGER, body VARCHAR) WITH (storage = 'search')

statement ok
INSERT INTO pdm_s SELECT id, body FROM pdm

statement ok
VACUUM (REFRESH_TABLE) pdm_s

statement ok
CREATE INDEX pdm_s_text ON pdm_s USING inverted (id, body pdm_words)

statement ok
VACUUM (REFRESH_TABLE) pdm_s

query
EXPLAIN SELECT id FROM pdm_text WHERE body @@ to_tsquery('"qu* fox"~2')
